{"title": "Count The Touches", "type": "One trick", "hooks": ["Don't buy just under resistance. Count the touches first.", "Before you buy near a level, count how often it turned price.", "Stop buying into resistance. Count the touches instead."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Don't buy just under resistance. Count the touches first.", "text": "Count the touches first", "chart": 0, "win": [6, 101], "show": 76}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Count the touches", "show": 76, "vo": "This level has already turned the price twice. Here's the first touch, and here's the second.", "cues": [{"say": "the first touch", "do": "mark", "i": 60, "label": "A", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "here's the second", "do": "mark", "i": 71, "label": "B", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}], "win": [6, 101]}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Hold or break?", "vo": "Now the price is back at the level. Does it hold and turn down, or break and keep going?", "win": [6, 101], "options": ["It holds: the price turns down from the resistance", "It breaks: the price closes through the resistance and keeps going"], "answer": 0, "show": 76, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 189.84, "label": "Resistance", "tone": "level"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "It held", "vo": "It held. The price turned away from the resistance, and twenty-five candles later it was down three point six percent.", "win": [6, 101], "reveal_to": 101, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 63, "label": "Sw", "side": "high"}]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Check before the test", "vo": "Before the test, check three things: how many touches, which way the trend runs, and whether volume dries up into it.", "items": [{"text": "Count the touches", "sub": "How often it turned price", "icon": "chart"}, {"text": "Check the trend", "sub": "Which way it runs", "icon": "down"}, {"text": "Watch the volume", "sub": "Drying up, or gr